course: dictionary
lesson: 1693
title: One word, many meanings
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: One word can have many meanings, and the words around it tell you which one you need. Chuck is a good example. «At the zoo Kieran bangs on the monkey glass, and a monkey chucks something disgusting at it.» Here chuck means throw, because a monkey throws things.
explain: Chuck can also be a friendly word for a person. Pat the lollipop lady says, «Lovely weather for ducks, chuck!» Nobody is being thrown anywhere. Pat is being friendly, like saying love or dear.
explain: Some phrases use chuck in a different way. «It's chucking it down, mun, and the thunder's a million miles off.» Chucking it down means raining hard. A child who thinks chuck means throw would be confused, so read the whole sentence and ask what would make sense.
fact: Chuck usually means to throw something, often in a casual way.
fact: Chuck out or chuck away means to throw something in the bin.
fact: Chuck it in means to give something up or quit.
fact: Chuck it down means to rain heavily, as in «It's chucking it down».
fact: In northern England, chuck is a friendly word for a person, like love or dear. It is informal, so use it with care.
exercise: «At the zoo a monkey chucks something disgusting at Kieran.» What does chucks mean here? | *Throws | Sleeps on | Hugs | Gives a sweet to
exercise: Pat says, «Lovely weather for ducks, chuck!» What does chuck mean in this sentence? | A part of a drill | *A friendly word for a person, like love or dear | A day off school pretending to be ill | A throw
exercise: Cerys says, «It's chucking it down, mun.» What does chucking it down mean? | Going to the shop | Tidying up | *Raining hard | Throwing a ball
test: Mum says, «Let's chuck these old toys out.» What does chuck out mean? | *Throw them away | Paint them | Lend them to a friend | Give them a hug
test: Sam says, «I'm going to chuck it in and quit the club.» What does chuck it in mean? | Start it again | Win the club | Sing about it | *Give it up
exam: In a maths problem, «Ali chucks a beanbag into the hoop.» What does chucks mean? | Chucks a sickie | Gives up | Is a part of a drill | *Throws
